@startuml
title RF8 — Contrato do head coach e relação com a diretoria · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "MoraleEngine" as MoraleEngine
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
actor "Diretoria da franquia (IA)" as Diretoria
Manager -> Frontend: abre painel do head coach
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/manager
API -> UseCase: GetManagerPanelUseCase.execute(id, userId)
UseCase -> MySQL: save + owner check · contrato · metas · standing · moral · histórico · propostas
alt não é dono
  UseCase -> AuditService: record(ACCESS_DENIED)
  API --> Frontend: 403
else senão
  UseCase --> API: ManagerPanelResult
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Manager -> Frontend: pedir aumento
Frontend -> API: POST /careers/{id}/manager/raise-request {amount, reason}
API -> UseCase: RequestSalaryRaiseUseCase.execute(cmd)
UseCase -> MySQL: contrato ACTIVE? intervalo? moral?
alt não empregado / intervalo / moral < 50
  API --> Frontend: 409 | 422
else senão
  UseCase -> MoraleEngine: boardDecision(moralClub, vitórias × expectedWins, playoffs, títulos, seed)
  MoraleEngine -> Diretoria: score determinístico
  Diretoria --> UseCase: ACCEPT | COUNTER | REJECT
  alt ACCEPT
    UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE manager_contract.salaryPerSeason · INSERT ledger WAGES
    UseCase -> EventBus: InboxMessageCreated(BOARD, aumento aprovado)
  else senão
    UseCase -> MySQL: moralClub −5 se REJECT · INSERT inbox_message
    UseCase -> EventBus: InboxMessageCreated(BOARD)
  end
  EventBus -> Cassandra: appendInbox(saveId)
  API --> Frontend: 200 RaiseResult
end
Manager -> Frontend: pedir demissão (confirmado)
Frontend -> API: POST /careers/{id}/manager/resign {confirm: true}
API -> UseCase: ResignUseCase.execute(id, userId) «@Transactional»
UseCase -> MySQL: TX: contrato RESIGNED · save.club = null · UNEMPLOYED · ManagerCareerRecord(endReason RESIGNED)
UseCase -> AuditService: record(MANAGER_RESIGNED)
UseCase -> EventBus: ManagerDismissed(saveId, RESIGNED)
EventBus -> Cassandra: inbox: despedida da diretoria · notícia
EventBus -> Redis: ranking de head coaches atualizado
API --> Frontend: 200 → modo espectador
@enduml
